<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx5.SSx2.SSSx2.Px3" title="In Ablation ‣ MoRA: On-the-fly Molecule-aware Low-Rank Adaptation Framework for LLM-based Multi-Modal Molecular Assistant" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">The number of blocks of the perceptual weights generator.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#Sx6" title="In MoRA: On-the-fly Molecule-aware Low-Rank Adaptation Framework for LLM-based Multi-Modal Molecular Assistant" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#Sx7" title="In MoRA: On-the-fly Molecule-aware Low-Rank Adaptation Framework for LLM-based Multi-Modal Molecular Assistant" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Appendix</span></a>
