<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Performance comparison on forward reaction prediction and retrosynthesis tasks. The arrows (<math id="Sx3.T1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow,\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em" stretchy="false">↑</mo><mo>,</mo><mo lspace="0em" stretchy="false">↓</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow,\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math>) indicate whether higher or lower values are better. †: few-shot ICL results from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">Fang et al. 2023</a>)</cite>.</figcaption>
