<span id="Sx7.T9.1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">The molecule is an <span id="Sx7.T9.1.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1932B4;">acyl tetraketide pyran-2-one</span> that is <span id="Sx7.T9.1.2.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1932B4;">4-hydroxy-2H-pyran-2-one</span> in which the hydrogen at <span id="Sx7.T9.1.2.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1932B4;">position 6</span> is replaced by a <span id="Sx7.T9.1.2.3.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1932B4;">13-methyl-2-oxo</span><span id="Sx7.T9.1.2.3.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#D22828;">tetradecyl</span> group.</span>
